# Grading Worksheet — ASHFALL OUTPOST Candidate

**F1 Core loop**: `state` object; `rngNext`/`rnd(s)` seeded PRNG (s.rng.a) used throughout; `finishTurn()` calls processStorm→processProduction→processNeeds→processDepartures→processSkillGrowth→processGrowth→decrementEffects→processCaravan in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 Map**: 8x8 (`s.grid` 64 tiles) via `generateGrid` using `rnd(s)`; `canBuild` checks `def.terrain.includes(tile.terrain)`; `adjacencyMultiplier` changes `totalMult` in `processProduction`. Score 2.

**F3 Economy**: quarry→ore→forge→metal; ashsifter→soil→greenhouse→food (`def.consume`/`def.produce`); `getCap`+`addResource` enforce caps and log overflow loss. Score 2.

**F4 Population**: colonist records `{skill,fatigue,morale,job,assignedBuilding}`; `skillMult`, `moraleMult`, `fatigueMult` read in `processProduction`. Score 2.

**F5 Needs**: `processNeeds` consumes food/water per active colonist; shortage → `c.morale-=8`; `moraleMult` feeds back into output; morale recovers (+1/+2) when needs met. Score 2.

**F6 Research**: 10 `RESEARCH_DEFS`; `purchaseResearch` checks `rd.prereq.every(...)`; costs deducted; `rd.apply(s)` writes `s.mods`/`s.unlocked`, read in production and `canBuild`. Score 2.

**F7 Events**: 13 `EVENT_DEFS`; `drawEvent` does weighted pick (`totalWeight`); 6 events (`ruinsDiscovery`, `colonistDispute`, `sicknessOutbreak`, `refugeesArrive`, `scavengersCache`, `moraleFestival`) have 2-3 differing-outcome choices; `eventCooldowns`+`eligibleEvents` enforce cooldown. Score 2.

**F8 Trade**: `caravanBuyPrice`/`caravanSellPrice` read `stockRatio` and `s.caravan.drift` (drifts each turn in `processCaravan`); `item.qty/cap` limits inventory; `tradeBuy`/`tradeSell` both wired to buttons. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard**: `processStorm` fires every 7th turn, severity scales with `s.turn`; damages `b.hp`; `hpFactor=b.hp/100` reduces `finalMult` in production; `stormShieldingI/II`+watchtower mitigate; `repairBuilding` spends parts/scrip and restores hp. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load**: `exportSave` → `JSON.stringify(state)` into textarea; `importSave` parses, `validateStateShape` checks fields, error shown in `#saveError`. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions**: `checkEndConditions` — lose at `active<=0`, win at `turn>maxTurns && active>=12 && food>0 && water>0`; `computeScore` combines pop/research/stockpile/turns; `renderEndScreen` shows summary. Score 2.

**F12 UI**: `renderTabs` switches tabs; log lines show `T${l.turn}`; `.tip` tooltips explain numbers (e.g. adjacency, fatigue formula); keydown handles Space/1-5; `@media (max-width:480px)` layout. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel**: `runTests()` has ~18 real-invariant assertions (cap respect, assignment consistency, storm damage, skill cap, trade math, win/lose); `runBenchmark` runs 200 headless turns via `greedyPolicyPreTurn`+`runGameTurn(s,true)`, prints `hashState`. Score 2.

**G1**: `basicMetallurgy.apply` sets `s.mods.forgeYield`; `RESEARCH_YIELD_KEY` maps forge→forgeYield; `processProduction` reads `researchMult` every turn. Score 4.

**G2**: `processNeeds` shortage → `c.morale-=8`; next `processProduction` call reads `moraleMult(c.morale)` into `laborMult`. Score 4.

**G3**: `processStorm` damages `b.hp`; `hpFactor=b.hp/100` cuts `finalMult`; `repairBuilding` spends parts/scrip and sets `b.hp=100`. Score 4.

**G4**: `caravanBuyPrice`/`caravanSellPrice` read `s.resources[item.res]/getCap` and `s.caravan.drift[item.res]`, drift updates in `processCaravan`. Score 4.

**G5**: `colonistDispute` (mediate/ignore/punish) and `refugeesArrive` (welcome/turn away) each write different `s.resources`/`c.morale`/`s.colonists` changes, not just log text. Score 4.

No file-wide syntax defect spotted on read-through (script tags closed, braces balanced as far as traced).

